{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2023-05-04 08:01:00', 'title': 'THE BALL® BRAND EXPANDS KEEPSAKE JAR COLLECTION WITH NEW HONEYBEE-EMBOSSED JARS TO COMMEMORATE WORLD BEE DAY', 'text': 'THE BALL® HONEYBEE KEEPSAKE JAR CELEBRATES THE IMPORTANT ROLE BEES PLAY IN POLLINATING AND PRESERVING THE FRUITS AND VEGETABLES CANNERS LOVE. ATLANTA , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN ANTICIPATION OF WORLD BEE DAY ON MAY 20, THE BALL® BRAND, A PART OF THE NEWELL BRANDS GLOBAL PORTFOLIO, HAS LAUNCHED ITS LATEST INNOVATION – THE BALL® HONEYBEE KEEPSAKE JARS – HONORING THE UNSUNG GARDEN HERO: THE HONEYBEE.'}